      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The mirelurk queen&nbsp;is bigger than most characters, towering over them. The creature receives an additional +1 health point per Level, but its Defense decreases by 1, to a minimum of 1. Further, it only suffers a Critical Hit if an attack inflicts 7+ damage (after damage resistance) in a single hit, rather than the normal 5+.</span></p>",
        "favorite": false
