      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The mirelurk queen is quick to action when it senses prey. When the mirelurk queen&nbsp;enters a scene, immediately generate 1 Action Point. If the mirelurk queen is an ally, then this goes into the group pool. If it is an enemy, it goes into the GM&rsquo;s pool.</span></p>",
